{"Title":"An Act exempting veterans from the standard registration fee for veterans license plates","BillNumber":"H3332","DocketNumber":"HD4062","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"RMH1","Name":"Richard M. Haggerty","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RMH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:42:47.06"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"RMH1","Name":"Richard M. Haggerty","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RMH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:42:47.06"},{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:43:15.0066667"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-06T08:46:40.54"},{"Id":"BPC0","Name":"Brendan P. Crighton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BPC0","ResponseDate":"2023-07-11T12:32:28.19"},{"Id":"JBL0","Name":"Joan B. Lovely","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBL0","ResponseDate":"2023-08-08T09:45:09.4333333"},{"Id":"ALS1","Name":"Aaron L. Saunders","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/ALS1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-13T09:08:44.1433333"},{"Id":"JBA1","Name":"Jennifer Balinsky Armini","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-08T09:44:39.94"},{"Id":"SBA1","Name":"Shirley B. Arriaga","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SBA1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-09T08:53:53.22"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:42:47.06"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3332/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Haggerty of Woburn and Day of Stoneham, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3332) of Richard M. Haggerty and Michael S. Day relative to exempting veterans from the standard registration fee for veterans license plates.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 2 of chapter 90 of the Generals Laws, as appearing in the 2012 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after line 551, the following new paragraph:-\r\n\tThe registrar shall furnish, upon application, to owners of private passenger motor vehicles and motorcycles who are veterans, as defined in clause Forty-third of section 7 of chapter 4 and upon presentation of evidence deemed satisfactory by the registrar, distinctive registration plates bearing on the left side the word \"VETERAN''. The registrar shall waive the initial registration fee of $60 and for each subsequent renewal.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}